{\int\limits_{\mathbb{S}_{\wtilde D-1}}g(x,\theta)^{\wtilde D} d\theta}
\\
&\leq \frac{\wtilde Dc_1 \sigma\alpha}{\tau} \frac{ \left(\xi\int\limits_{\Omega_1} g(x,\theta)^{\wtilde D+1}  d\theta + \int\limits_{\Omega_2} g(x,\theta)^{\wtilde D+1}  d\theta \right)}
